{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36572","headline":"得宣州窦尚书书因投寄二首 一 · 罗隐","name":"得宣州窦尚书书因投寄二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"双鱼迢递到江滨，伤感南陵旧主人。\n万里朝台劳寄梦，十年侯国阻趋尘。\n寻知乱後尝辞禄，共喜闲来得养神。\n时见齐山敬亭客，不堪戎马战征频。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36572.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36572","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}